      "@id": "https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2026.11.04.15.08.01/daml.runtime.grpc.0.7.0.json#deprecation/alternatePackage",
      "id": "Canton.Ledger.Grpc.Client",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "Removed in 0.7.1. The DamlValueConverter moved into Canton.Ledger.Grpc.Client as an internal type, so no Daml.* package depends on a Canton.* one. Reference Canton.Ledger.Grpc.Client instead: it converts values on every submission, query and subscription. If you called DamlValueConverter.ToProtoValue or FromProtoValue directly, map the generated Canton.Ledger.Grpc proto types yourself.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "Bidirectional conversion between Daml.Runtime value types and Canton Ledger API v2 protobuf messages.",
